OL,3,GNEWSASchool 'reflecting carefully' over
OL,4,Aex-teacher's abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school has said it is "reflecting
OL,7,Fcarefully" after a jailed former
OL,8,Fteacher was found to have sexually
OL,9,Fabused some of its pupils in the 1980s.
OL,11,FWarwick Schools Foundation, which runs
OL,12,FWarwick School in Myton Rd, made the
OL,13,Fcomment in a letter to former pupils,
OL,14,Fin which they addressed the crimes
OL,15,Fcommitted by Paul Stainsby.
OL,17,FThe 76-year-old was sentenced to 14
OL,18,Fyears in prison in 2022 for sexual
OL,19,Foffences committed while teaching at a
OL,20,Fschool in Essex in the 1970s.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
