OL,3,GNEWSASchool 'reflecting carefully' over
OL,4,Aex-teacher's abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a trial of the facts on Tuesday,
OL,7,Fa jury at Warwick Crown Court found
OL,8,Fthat he had committed 10 further
OL,9,Foffences against five pupils at Warwick
OL,10,FSchool, where he worked from 1981 to
OL,11,F1989.
